      "content": "hey i just finished my first marathon training block and my legs are absolutely trashed. like i can barely walk down stairs without crying lol. i need to get some sleep so i can go again tomorrow but the soreness is keeping me up. what's the most i can take of tylenol in a day to actually knock this pain out? i don't want to take too little and feel like crap in the morning.",
